      "review_summary": "The PR marks exact MCP serve and ACP protocol invocations as stdout-owning during CLI startup, adds argv-aware ACP matching, and covers MCP/ACP/non-protocol cases with focused tests.\n\nPR surface: Source +62, Tests +75. Total +137 across 9 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. Source inspection shows current main only suppresses startup stdout for JSON mode, while docs and server code show MCP/ACP are stdio protocol paths that can run config/bootstrap before action-level stderr routing; the PR body also supplies live MCP before/after stdout evidence.",
